# Hooks that may run on a job thread and change script state, as found when
# tools/scripts-threads.py was written (2026-11-20): neither proven to run on
# the game thread nor reworked to queue. The check reports them (--list) and
# fails on any hook that is not listed here; a line whose hook became clean, or
# says why (`// game thread only:`, `// job thread safe:`), must go: this list
# only shrinks. One line per file and method: `File.reds Class.Method`.

# Per NPC, vehicle, device, component or projectile, in play: the engine may run
# two of them at once (entity events on job threads), and each writes a
# system's fields or arrays. The crash class of 2026-11-20 once it happens
# while the world streams in. To rework first: queue, act on the tick.
Breach.reds Device.OnAccessPointMiniGameStatus
Breach.reds ScriptedPuppet.OnAccessPointMiniGameStatus
Combat.reds NPCPuppet.OnStatusEffectApplied
Hacks.reds NPCPuppet.OnStatusEffectApplied
HitReactions.reds HitReactionComponent.SendTwitchDataToAnimationGraph
HitReactions.reds NPCPuppet.OnRagdollEnabledEvent
HitReactions.reds NPCPuppet.OnRagdollDisabledEvent
Interact.reds Device.ExecuteAction
Interact.reds Inventory.OnInteractionUsed
Reactions.reds NPCStatesComponent.OnCombat
Stealth.reds StimBroadcasterComponent.TriggerSingleBroadcast
Takedowns.reds ScriptedPuppet.TriggerNewPerkFinisherBluntHold
Takedowns.reds DisposalDevice.OnDisposeBody
Takedowns.reds DisposalDevice.OnTakedownAndDisposeBody
Takedowns.reds DisposalDevice.OnNonlethalTakedownAndDisposeBody
Throws.reds BaseGrenade.OnShoot
Throws.reds BaseGrenade.Detonate
Throws.reds BaseGrenade.Release
Throws.reds MeleeProjectile.OnShoot
Throws.reds MeleeProjectile.OnShootTarget
Throws.reds MeleeProjectile.OnCollision
Throws.reds MeleeProjectile.TryToReleaseProjectile
Throws.reds ProjectileLauncherRound.OnShoot
Throws.reds ProjectileLauncherRound.OnShootTarget
Throws.reds ProjectileLauncherRound.ExecuteGameEffect
Throws.reds ProjectileLauncherRound.Release
Time.reds BaseBullet.OnProjectileInitialize
Time.reds BaseProjectile.OnProjectileInitialize
Traffic.reds VehicleObject.OnMountingEvent
Traffic.reds VehicleObject.OnVehicleBumpEvent
Wheels.reds VehicleObject.DamagePipelineFinalized
Wheels.reds VehicleObject.OnVehicleBumpEvent
Wheels.reds GameObject.OnVehicleHit
Wheels.reds VehicleComponent.OnGridDestruction
Wheels.reds VehicleComponent.OnVehicleOnPartDetached
Wheels.reds VehicleComponent.OnWeaponShootEvent

# Our own V's entity: one instance, so never two at once; not proven to be in
# step with the tick.
Loot.reds PlayerPuppet.OnItemAddedToInventory
Outcomes.reds PlayerPuppet.OnSetSlowMoForOnePunchAttackEvent
Revive.reds PlayerPuppet.OnResurrected
Story.reds PlayerPuppet.OnSceneTierChange

# UI controllers and menu scenarios, input listeners (OnAction), blackboard and
# UI-system listeners: one at a time and never per streamed entity; not proven
# to be in step with the tick (a DelaySystem callback).
Activities.reds TandemActivities.OnAction
Activities.reds TimeskipGameController.OnUninitialize
Activities.reds MenuScenario_BaseMenu.OnLeaveScenario
Activities.reds MenuScenario_NetworkBreach.OnEnterScenario
Activities.reds MenuScenario_ArcadeMinigame.OnEnterScenario
